  "document": "Veerendra\nVeerendra  was a Punjabi film actor, director, producer and writer who made 25 films in his 12-year career. Veerinder Singh, often known as Veerendra, made his debut with the film \"Teri Meri Ek Jindri,\" released in 1975, featuring Dharmendra. He was a regular in Punjabi films of the 1980s. Some of his more popular films were \"Lambhardarni, Balbiro Bhabhi\" and \"Dushmani Dee Agg,\" which was released after his death."
